      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MASHED POTATO (1) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (25.18) last time in a T3 RSTW at Bendigo. Solid winning record at this trip. Can make amends. SAINT FRANKLIN (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (25.20) in a T3 RSTW at Bendigo. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and is one of the better chances. TRACKMAN TIM (7) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Geelong over 400m behind My Mate Charlie (23.16) in a Mix 6/7. Was in the money prior to that. The form out of last run is most impressive. Should be about the mark. BLACK SABOTAGE (4) can run a bold race on best form.",
